  "causebase_summary": "Australian Christian Channel Pty Ltd (operating a service called GOOD) is presented on its website (watchgood.com) as a streaming television and on‑demand service. The site states the GOOD app can be downloaded for mobile phones and tablets (iOS v12+ and Android v7+), and that GOOD is available on web, Apple TV, Smart TV, Foxtel, Fetch and Chromecast. The website publishes program listings and short articles under headings such as Faith and Culture, Entertainment & The Arts, Lifestyle, Families and Health and Wellness (examples dated 4–9 August 2026 are shown). The site invites users to sign up for a newsletter for program news and behind‑the‑scenes content. An ACNC Register extract for Australian Christian Channel Pty Ltd was observed in the evidence pack. The evidence is primarily the organisation’s website and the ACNC record; the website’s statements about device availability and content categories are reported here as claims from the organisation’s site.",
